# Windsurf Rules — dbv-tauri-starter

This project uses **Spec-Driven Development (SDD)** with the **dbv-specs-ops** framework, vendored under `dbv-specs-ops/`. Apply these rules in all interactions.

## Before proposing any code

1. Read `dbv-specs-ops/project.config.md` for project name, author, license and file header template
2. Read `dbv-specs-ops/docs/SPECIFICATIONS.md` for the current requirements
3. Read `dbv-specs-ops/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` for the stack and technical decisions
4. Read `dbv-specs-ops/memory.md` for qualitative context and technical decisions
5. Read `dbv-specs-ops/task.md` for the current project state

The full workflow and development rules are in `dbv-specs-ops/docs/MASTER_PROMPT.md`.

## ⚠️ Core Rules (Strong Pointer)

**Read `dbv-specs-ops/docs/MASTER_PROMPT.md` and follow its workflow strictly.**

